          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calabi-Yau+object"} Calabi-Yau object
              %ul
                %li
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calabi-Yau+algebra"}> Calabi-Yau algebra
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %strong Calabi-Yau manifold
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+Calabi-Yau+manifold"} generalized Calabi-Yau manifold
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calabi-Yau+cohomology"} Calabi-Yau cohomology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/moduli+space+of+Calabi-Yau+spaces"} moduli space of Calabi-Yau spaces
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SU-cobordism+theory"} SU-cobordism theory
          %h2#references References
          %p The original articles:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shing-Tung+Yau"}> Shing-Tung Yau
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the Ricci curvature of a compact Kähler manifold and the complex Monge-Ampére equation
              %p
                %strong 31
                3 (1978) 339-411 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1002/cpa.3160310304"}> doi:10.1002/cpa.3160310304
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Surveys and review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shing-Tung+Yau"}> Shing-Tung Yau
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.scholarpedia.org/article/Calabi-Yau_manifold"} Calabi-Yau manifold
              %strong 4
              86524 (2009) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4249/scholarpedia.6524"}> doi
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Motivated from the relation between
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry+and+Calabi-Yau+manifolds"} supersymmetry and Calabi-Yau manifolds
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tristan+H%C3%BCbsch"}> Tristan Hübsch
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Calabi-Yau Manifolds – A Bestiary for Physicists
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/1410"} doi:10.1142/1410
          %p
            In terms of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-structure"} G-structure
          %ul
            %li#Vezzoni06
              %p
                Luigi Vezzoni,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    The geometry of some special
                    = succeed "-structure" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi SU
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                            %mi n
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SU(n)
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/14699671.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/VezzoniSUnStructure.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#Prins16
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dani%C3%ABl+Prins"}> Daniël Prins
                , Section 1.3 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    On flux vacua,
                    = succeed "-structures" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi SU
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                            %mi n
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SU(n)
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.05415"} arXiv:1602.05415
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://tel.archives-ouvertes.fr/tel-01280717"} tel:01280717
          %p
            Discussion of the case of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/positive+number"} positive
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/characteristic"} characteristic
            includes
          %ul
            %li#GeerKatsura03
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gerard+van+der+Geer"}> Gerard van der Geer
              , T. Katsura,
              %em On the height of Calabi-Yau varieties in positive characteristic
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0302023"}> arXiv:math/0302023
              )
          %p
            The following page collects information on Calabi-Yau manifolds with an eye to application in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            (e.g.
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry+and+Calabi-Yau+manifolds"} supersymmetry and Calabi-Yau manifolds
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sheldon+Katz"}> Sheldon Katz
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rolf+Schimmrigk"} Rolf Schimmrigk
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://www.th.physik.uni-bonn.de/th/Supplements/cy.html"} CALABI-YAU
          %p Discussion of the relation between the various shades of definitions includes
          %ul
            %li
              MathOverflow:
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://mathoverflow.net/q/42707/381"} Calabi-Yau manifolds
          %p
            Mathematical review of the relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quiver+representations"} quiver representations
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mirror+symmetry"} mirror symmetry
            includes
          %ul
            %li
              Yang-Hui He,
              %em Calabi-Yau Varieties: from Quiver Representations to Dessins d’Enfants
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.09398"}> arXiv:1611.09398
              )
          %p
            Discussion of CYs in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/positive+characteristic"} positive characteristic
            includes
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Philip+Candelas"}> Philip Candelas
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xenia+de+la+Ossa"} Xenia de la Ossa
                %em Calabi-Yau Manifolds Over Finite Fields, I
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0012233"}> arXiv:hep-th/0012233
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Philip+Candelas"}> Philip Candelas
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xenia+de+la+Ossa"} Xenia de la Ossa
                %em Calabi-Yau Manifolds Over Finite Fields, II
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0402133"}> arXiv:hep-th/0402133
                )
          %p
            Discussion of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calabi-Yau+orbifolds"} Calabi-Yau orbifolds
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominic+Joyce"}> Dominic Joyce
                ,
                %em On the topology of desingularizations of Calabi-Yau orbifolds
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9806146"}> arXiv:math/9806146
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/485280"} spire:485280
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominic+Joyce"}> Dominic Joyce
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Deforming Calabi-Yau orbifolds
                %a{:href => "https://dx.doi.org/10.4310/AJM.1999.v3.n4.a7"} doi:10.4310/AJM.1999.v3.n4.a7
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.intlpress.com/site/pub/files/_fulltext/journals/ajm/1999/0003/0004/AJM-1999-0003-0004-a007.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominic+Joyce"}> Dominic Joyce
                , Section 6.5.1 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Compact Manifolds with Special Holonomy
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://global.oup.com/academic/product/compact-manifolds-with-special-holonomy-9780198506010?cc=de&lang=en&"} ISBN:9780198506010
            %li
              %p
                Wei-Dong Ruan, Yuguang Zhang,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Convergence of Calabi-Yau manifolds
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0905.3424"} arXiv:0905.3424
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2011.06.023"} doi:10.1016/j.aim.2011.06.023
            %li
              %p
                Ronan J. Conlon, Anda Degeratu, Frédéric Rochon,
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Quasi-asymptotically conical Calabi-Yau manifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.04410"} arXiv:1611.04410
          %p
            and in view of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mirror+symmetry"} mirror symmetry
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Shi-Shyr Roan,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The mirror of Calabi-Yau orbifold
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0129167X91000259"} doi:10.1142/S0129167X91000259
            %li
              %p
                Alan Stapledon,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em New mirror pairs of Calabi-Yau orbifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1011.5006"} arXiv:1011.5006
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calabi-Yau+manifolds+in+SU-bordism+theory"} Calabi-Yau manifolds in SU-bordism theory
          %ul
            %li#LLP17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Limonchenko"}> Ivan Limonchenko
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhi+Lu"} Zhi Lu
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Taras+Panov"} Taras Panov
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Calabi-Yau hypersurfaces and SU-bordism
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1712.07350"} arXiv:1712.07350
            %li#CLP19
              %p
                Georgy Chernykh,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ivan+Limonchenko"} Ivan Limonchenko
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Taras+Panov"} Taras Panov
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi SU
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SU
                    \-bordism: structure results and geometric representatives
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1903.07178"} arXiv:1903.07178
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Taras+Panov"}> Taras Panov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    A geometric view on
                    = succeed "-bordism" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi SU
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SU
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.math.princeton.edu/events/geometric-view-su-bordism-2020-09-17t170000"} webpage
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://higeom.math.msu.su/people/taras/talks/2019SPb-Panov.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/PanovSU-Bordism.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
